{room, key=club_malloc, name=Club Malloc
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
North West: storage
West: exit the club
North East: stair case
East: enter the dance floor
South: sit at the bar
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        {act, logic=story, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {story
        {message
            output={@

There is a small storage room in the northwest corner of the club.
Along the south wall is a vast bar with three bartenders working it.
In the east end of the dance floor is a tall DJ setup.

            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

The club is packed with people dancing, drinking and talking. They are dressed
in the cutting edge of Shellspace cybernetic fashion. Various limbs and aspects
of their bodies are classically augmented or comprised of strange virtual
reality constructs.

The bass-heavy music pulses and throbs, vibrating the walls and floor.

The DJ at the east end of the dance floor is a tall woman who is mostly
chrome paneled body parts. Her eyes are solid black and she is wearing a
full body black vinyl outfit.

In the north east corner of the room you see a staircase ascending to a
second floor.

Northwest of where you are is a small door marked 'storage'.

There are three bartenders working the long winding bar that is set along
the south wall of the club.

            }
        }

        {logic, name=Club Malloc tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }

    {inject, logic=./objects/crowd.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/bar.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/bartender.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/dj.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/music.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/stairs.inj }


    
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_west))
        {move, logic=hrbr_north, tags=[player]
            output={@

You exit the club.

            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_north_east))
        {move, logic=club_malloc_upst, tags=[player]
            output={@

You go upstairs.

            }
        }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_north_west))
        {move, logic=club_malloc_storage, tags=[player]
            output={@

You step into the storage room...

            }
        }
    }

    
    
    {dev_note, tags=Testing, active=true
        output={@
[ ] : Room
[ ] : Look
[ ] : Story
>   [ ] : crowd
>   [ ] : music
>   [ ] : dj
>   [ ] : stairs
>   [ ] : bartender
>   [ ] : bar

[ ] : Navigation
        }
    }
}
